                textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white, fontSize: 11),
              ),
            ],
          ),
        ),
        content: SizedBox(
          width: 650,
          child: SingleChildScrollView(
            child: Column(
              crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
              children: [
                detail("Bill Number", bill.billNumber, bold: true),
